OL,5,     GLisa Meyer, artistic director and
OL,6,     Gco-founder of Birmingham's
OL,7,     GSupersonic Festival previews some
OL,8,     Gof the acts playing this year's
OL,9,     Gevent.
OL,10,G0100FInsight: New Orleans
OL,11,     GCharlie Gillett tells the musical
OL,12,     Gstory of the city of New Orleans,
OL,13,     Gincluding artists such as Fats
OL,14,     GDomino, Jewel King, Professor
OL,15,     GLonghair, Huey 'Piano' Smith and
OL,16,     Gthe Meters.
OL,17,G0200FInsight - Sun Records
OL,18,     GInsight - Sun Records of Memphis,
OL,19,     GTennessee. The late Charlie
OL,20,     GGillett tells the story of the
OL,21,     Ginfluential record label.
